    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Walmart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Hotel / Airbnb Reservation</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Learn how to sell the same room-night only once, even when two people click \"Book\" in the same millisecond. You will learn date-range inventory, holds that expire, optimistic locking and idempotent payments well enough to drive a 45-minute interview.</p>\n      "
